"%@ 次" = "%@";
"App 資訊" = "App information";
"「傷口面積」使用 LiDAR 深度與圈選輪廓估算皮膚表面積。角度、光線、深度品質與圈選都會影響結果。本 App 為健康參考工具，非醫療診斷；傷口有惡化跡象請就醫。" = "Wound area uses LiDAR depth and the outline to estimate skin surface area. Angle, lighting, depth quality and the outline affect the result. This app is a health reference tool, not a medical diagnosis. Seek medical care if the wound worsens.";
"・正對傷口拍攝（斜拍會造成面積誤差，App 會提醒）\n・距離 25–40 公分，等中央對焦框變綠再按快門\n・光線充足、避免反光與濕亮面\n・只拍傷口部位：請勿讓臉部、證件或可辨識個人的物品入鏡（尤其開啟研究上傳時）\n・小於 1 cm² 的傷口誤差較大，數字僅供趨勢參考" = "• Face the wound directly; oblique capture can affect area estimates and may trigger a warning.\n• Keep about 25-40 cm away and wait for the center focus box to turn green.\n• Use sufficient light; avoid glare and wet reflective surfaces.\n• Frame only the wound region. Keep faces, documents and identifying objects out of view, especially with research uploads on.\n• Areas below 1 cm² have greater relative uncertainty; values are for trend reference.";
