"個人服務與研究上傳分開計算。核對額度不傳照片，也不會預留或扣除辨識次數。" = "Personal service and research uploads are counted separately. Checking quota sends no photo and does not reserve or use an analysis.";
"個人辨識額度" = "Personal analysis quota";
"個人雲端辨識" = "Personal cloud analysis";
"傷口輪廓改由您手動圈選，量測計算全在裝置上完成。" = "You outline the wound manually. All measurement calculations run on the device.";
"先停止未來上傳，再送出撤回請求。既有影像與深度的可見媒體清除後無法復原；本機紀錄仍保留。若網路中斷，請回來重試查核。" = "Future uploads stop first, then a withdrawal request is sent. Once currently visible cloud photo and depth media are removed, they cannot be restored. Device records are retained. If the connection fails, return to retry verification.";
"先前已重新同意，目前因刪帳暫停上傳" = "Consent renewed earlier; uploads now paused for account deletion";
"先前撤回已完成，已清除的雲端影像與深度不會恢復。這次只重新同意之後新拍攝的資料上傳；舊紀錄、舊待傳及未上傳的本機照片都不會自動補送。沿用原裝置身分，並保留撤回與本次同意的稽核紀錄。" = "The previous withdrawal is complete. Removed cloud photos and depth data will not be restored. This consent covers only new captures made afterwards. Old records, pending submissions and previously unuploaded device photos will not be sent automatically. The original device identity is retained, along with audit records of the withdrawal and this consent.";
"先前的研究同意與撤回紀錄保留。因刪帳要求，目前研究上傳已暫停。" = "Previous research consent and withdrawal records remain. Research uploads are paused because of an account deletion request.";
"先查詢原登記是否已成功；僅伺服器確認尚未完成登記、目前服務沒有綁定紀錄且研究上傳仍獲同意時，才建立新的驗證。原驗證與處置稽核會保留，不刪紀錄、不恢復已撤回資料，也不傳送照片。" = "The original registration is checked first. New verification is created only if the server confirms registration is incomplete, this service has no linked records, and research consent is still active. Original verification and audit records are retained. No records are deleted, withdrawn data is not restored, and no photo is sent.";
"免費追蹤 1 處，Plus 每帳戶最多同時追蹤 5 處。每日個人辨識總額為免費 2 次、Plus 10 次。本機圈選、保存及分享時間軸 PDF 不扣辨識次數。" = "Free accounts can track 1 wound at a time; Plus allows up to 5 per account. The total daily personal analysis allowance is 2 for Free and 10 for Plus. Local outlining, saving and timeline PDF sharing do not use analysis quota.";
"內部驗證" = "Internal verification";
"兩種方式的量測數學完全相同；差別只在輪廓怎麼來、資料去不去雲端。" = "Both modes use the same measurement calculations. They differ in how the outline is obtained and whether data goes to the cloud.";
"原驗證仍在有效期間，未更換裝置身分。請稍後再核對，原紀錄保留。" = "The original verification is still valid. The device identity was not replaced. Check again later; original records are retained.";
"可在本機圈選，或登入後從量測頁選擇個人雲端辨識。個人服務和研究使用分開決定。" = "Outline on the device, or sign in and choose personal cloud analysis on the Measure screen. Personal service use and research participation are separate choices.";
"可在設定關閉未來上傳；另可要求撤回研究並清除本安裝目前可見的雲端影像與深度。本機紀錄保留；備份、歷史版本、研究標註與既有模型的刪除仍待驗證。" = "You can stop future uploads in Settings. Separately, you can request research withdrawal and removal of this installation's currently visible cloud photos and depth data. Device records are retained. Deletion of backups, historical versions, research annotations and existing models still requires verification.";
"可用次數" = "Available analyses";
"同意研究上傳" = "Agree to research uploads";
"同意研究上傳，使用自動辨識" = "Agree to research uploads and automatic analysis";
"因刪帳要求，這部手機已暫停研究上傳。請至帳號刪除頁核對已連結資料的撤回進度。" = "Research uploads on this phone are paused because of an account deletion request. Check the account deletion screen for withdrawal progress on linked data.";
"完全離線：照片與深度只留在手機，輪廓手動圈選。" = "Fully offline: photos and depth stay on the phone; outlines are drawn manually.";
"尚未取得符合範圍的雲端刪除確認，請稍後重試。" = "Deletion confirmation matching the requested scope has not been received. Try again later.";
"尚未取得重新加入的雲端確認，研究上傳保持關閉。原紀錄與這次同意要求已保留；請稍後核對同一次要求，不必重拍或重新登記裝置。" = "Rejoining is not confirmed by the server; research uploads remain off. Original records and this consent request are retained. Check the same request later; do not recapture or register the device again.";
"尚未確認此服務的原上傳身分，未取得雲端撤回收據；本機紀錄保留，不能視為雲端資料已刪除。" = "The original upload identity for this service is unconfirmed and no cloud withdrawal receipt has been received. Device records remain. This does not mean cloud data has been deleted.";
"已保留原撤回與本次重新同意紀錄。這只恢復今後的研究上傳，不代表舊服務資料已刪除或轉移。" = "The original withdrawal and this renewed consent are recorded. Only future research uploads resume. This does not mean old service data was deleted or transferred.";
"已保留原撤回與重新同意紀錄。舊服務資料未轉移，也未因本次操作刪除。" = "The original withdrawal and renewed consent records are retained. Data from the old service was neither transferred nor deleted by this action.";
"已取消尚未送出的撤回要求" = "Unsent withdrawal request cancelled";
"已完成" = "Completed";
"已確認清除目前可見媒體" = "Currently visible media removal confirmed";
"已確認重新加入。僅新的拍攝可研究上傳，先前撤回與手機紀錄保留，舊資料不會自動重傳。" = "Rejoining is confirmed. Only new captures can be uploaded for research. Earlier withdrawal and device records remain; old data is not automatically resent.";
"已確認重新加入。僅新的拍攝可研究上傳；先前撤回、舊待傳版本與手機紀錄保留，不會自動重傳。" = "Rejoining is confirmed. Only new captures can be uploaded for research. Earlier withdrawal, pending old revisions and device records remain without automatic resending.";
"已送出的研究照片若有修訂，會同步圈選與量測資料。重新開啟後，原同意期間仍在等候的研究送件也可能續傳。" = "Edits to a submitted research photo sync its outline and measurements. Reopening the app may also resume pending research submissions from the original consent period.";
"已重新同意：僅啟用新的研究上傳" = "Consent renewed: new research uploads only";
"後端忙碌；撤回要求已保留，等待後自動查核。研究上傳保持停用。" = "The service is busy. The withdrawal request is retained and verification will resume after waiting. Research uploads remain off.";
"必須取得雲端重新加入的確認，才會開啟研究上傳；中斷時保留同一次要求供核對。" = "Research uploads stay off until the server confirms rejoining. If interrupted, the same request is retained for verification.";
"您仍可保存傷口紀錄與分享時間軸 PDF。面積估算在裝置上完成。" = "You can still save wound records and share timeline PDFs. Area estimation runs on the device.";
"您可單獨撤回研究並保留服務帳號。若確認刪除服務帳號，會同時提出與該帳號連結的研究撤回；清理進度須另外核對。" = "You can withdraw from research and keep your service account. Confirming service account deletion also requests withdrawal of research linked to that account. Cleanup progress must be checked separately.";
"您可自行圈選，或登入個人服務後明確送出照片供辨識。同意研究上傳會讓符合研究條件的新紀錄進入研究送件流程。" = "You can outline manually, or sign in to the personal service and explicitly send a photo for analysis. Research consent allows eligible new records to enter the research submission process.";
"您正在重新同意研究上傳。僅在確認撤回尚未送出、此服務沒有已登記身分或綁定紀錄後，才會取消這次未送出的撤回。原撤回與本次選擇會保留；舊服務紀錄不會移轉或重傳。" = "You are giving research consent again. The unsent withdrawal is cancelled only after confirming that it was not submitted and this service has no registered identity or linked records. The original withdrawal and this choice are retained. Records from the old service will not be moved or resent.";
"手機紀錄、照片與深度資料設定排除系統備份。換機、刪除 App 或裝置遺失可能無法復原；研究上傳不等於個人備份。此設定不會清除過去已有的備份。" = "Device records, photos and depth data are excluded from system backups. They may not be recoverable after changing phones, removing the app or losing the device. Research uploads are not a personal backup. This setting does not remove earlier backups.";
"找不到可驗證的原安裝身分，尚未送出雲端撤回。舊版資料或遺失身分的資料需聯絡支援處理。" = "The original installation identity cannot be verified. Cloud withdrawal has not been sent. Contact support for older data or data with a lost identity.";
"拍攝後由雲端 AI 自動圈出傷口，再由您確認或修改。" = "Cloud AI outlines the wound after capture. You then check or edit the outline.";
"拍攝後，照片及深度加密存於本機。若您在量測頁選擇個人雲端辨識，僅選取的照片會送往服務，深度留在本機。" = "After capture, photos and depth data are encrypted on this device. If you choose personal cloud analysis on the Measure screen, only the selected photo is sent to the service. Depth stays on the device.";
