"關閉研究上傳只停止未來傳送，不會刪除已上傳資料。以下撤回適用於目前服務、此 App 保有可驗證身分的安裝；不刪除手機紀錄，也不代表其他服務或舊版匿名資料已刪除。" = "Switching research uploads off stops future sending; it does not delete uploaded data. Withdrawal below applies to the current service and installations whose identity this app can verify. It does not delete device records or confirm deletion from other services or older anonymous installations.";
"雲端尚未確認撤回，請檢查網路後重試。" = "Cloud withdrawal is not confirmed. Check your connection and retry.";
"雲端已受理撤回，正在等待先前的上傳結束。本機已保留撤回要求，App 開啟時會自動接續查核。" = "The server accepted withdrawal and is waiting for earlier uploads to finish. The request is saved on this device. Verification resumes automatically while the app is open.";
"雲端服務入口目前無法使用，辨識與上傳尚未開始。可手動圈選並存入手機；請保留原紀錄，待入口恢復後再處理。" = "Cloud service access is unavailable. Analysis and upload have not started. You can outline manually and save on the phone. Keep the original record until access is restored.";
"雲端登記尚未確認，已保留原身分與紀錄。請稍後再核對，不用重拍。" = "Cloud registration is not confirmed. The original identity and records are retained. Check again later; no new photo is needed.";
"雲端確認目前可見的影像與深度媒體已清除，該安裝的研究索引已停用。" = "The server confirms removal of currently visible photo and depth media. The research index for that installation is disabled.";
"雲端連線核對" = "Cloud connection verification";
"📴 不同意（完全離線）" = "Do not agree (fully offline)";
"🔬 同意研究上傳（啟用自動辨識）" = "Agree to research uploads (enable automatic analysis)";
